---
const youtubeChannelUrl = 'https://www.youtube.com/@arthurs-show';
const youtubeSubscribeUrl = `${youtubeChannelUrl}?sub_confirmation=1`;
---

<section class="youtube-subscribe-section" aria-labelledby="youtube-subscribe-title">
	<div class="youtube-subscribe-copy">
		<p class="youtube-subscribe-kicker">YOUTUBE CHANNEL</p>
		<h2 id="youtube-subscribe-title">YouTubeで最新メッセージを受け取る</h2>
		<p>登録後にベルをONにすると、新着メッセージの通知が届きます。</p>
	</div>
	<div class="youtube-subscribe-actions">
		<a class="youtube-subscribe-button" href={youtubeSubscribeUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="YouTubeでTHE ARTHUR HOLLANDS SHOWのチャンネル登録画面を開く">
			<span class="youtube-play-icon" aria-hidden="true">▶</span>
			<span>登録する</span>
		</a>
		<span class="youtube-notify-note">通知はYouTube側で設定</span>
	</div>
</section>

<style>
	.youtube-subscribe-section {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) auto;
		gap: 16px;
		align-items: center;
		margin: 18px 0 8px;
		padding: 16px 18px;
		background: #fff;
		color: #111;
		border: 1px solid #e4e4e7;
		border-left: 4px solid #d92323;
	}

	.youtube-subscribe-copy {
		display: grid;
		gap: 5px;
		min-width: 0;
	}

	.youtube-subscribe-kicker {
		width: fit-content;
		color: #d92323;
		font-family: 'Oswald', sans-serif;
		font-size: 0.7rem;
		font-weight: 900;
		letter-spacing: 0.12em;
		line-height: 1.1;
	}

	.youtube-subscribe-section h2 {
		margin: 0;
		font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 2.4vw, 1.36rem);
		font-weight: 900;
		line-height: 1.35;
		letter-spacing: 0;
		overflow-wrap: anywhere;
	}

	.youtube-subscribe-section p {
		margin: 0;
	}

	.youtube-subscribe-section p:not(.youtube-subscribe-kicker) {
		max-width: 42em;
		color: #666;
		font-size: 0.86rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		line-height: 1.55;
	}

	.youtube-subscribe-actions {
		display: grid;
		gap: 6px;
		justify-items: stretch;
		min-width: min(210px, 100%);
	}

	.youtube-subscribe-button {
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		gap: 8px;
		min-height: 40px;
		padding: 0 16px;
		background: #f4f4f5;
		border: 1px solid #d7d7dc;
		color: #111;
		font-size: 0.9rem;
		font-weight: 900;
		line-height: 1;
		text-align: center;
		text-decoration: none;
	}

	.youtube-subscribe-button:hover,
	.youtube-subscribe-button:focus-visible {
		background: #111;
		color: #fff;
		border-color: #111;
	}

	.youtube-play-icon {
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		width: 20px;
		height: 20px;
		background: #d92323;
		color: #fff;
		font-size: 0.7rem;
		line-height: 1;
	}

	.youtube-subscribe-button:hover .youtube-play-icon,
	.youtube-subscribe-button:focus-visible .youtube-play-icon {
		background: #d92323;
		color: #fff;
	}

	.youtube-notify-note {
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		min-height: 28px;
		padding: 0 10px;
		background: #f7f7f8;
		border: 1px solid #ececef;
		color: #666;
		font-size: 0.72rem;
		font-weight: 800;
		line-height: 1.2;
		text-align: center;
	}

	@media (max-width: 768px) {
		.youtube-subscribe-section {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
			gap: 12px;
			margin: 14px 0 4px;
			padding: 14px;
		}

		.youtube-subscribe-section h2 {
			font-size: 1.18rem;
		}

		.youtube-subscribe-actions {
			min-width: 0;
		}

		.youtube-subscribe-button,
		.youtube-notify-note {
			width: 100%;
		}
	}
</style>
